Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains NO third-party LaTeX template files.

The extension downloads class, style and bibliography-style files at runtime,
directly from the publishers that distribute them, and writes them into the
user's own Overleaf project. It does not redistribute them, and the MIT licence
above does not apply to them. Each remains under its own terms:

  acmart.cls, ACM-Reference-Format.bst, acm*.bbx/.cbx/.dbx
      Copyright ACM / Boris Veytsman. LaTeX Project Public License (LPPL).
      Fetched from https://www.acm.org/publications/proceedings-template

  IEEEtran.cls, IEEEtran.bst, IEEEtranS.bst, IEEEtranN.bst, IEEEtranSA.bst,
  IEEEtranSN.bst
      Copyright Michael Shell. LaTeX Project Public License (LPPL).
      Fetched from CTAN.

  llncs.cls, splncs04.bst
      Copyright Springer-Verlag. Distributed under Springer's own terms.
      Fetched from CTAN.

  elsarticle.cls
      Copyright Elsevier. Detected and reported only; never downloaded or
      modified by this tool.

  elsarticle-num.bst, elsarticle-harv.bst, elsarticle-num-names.bst
      Copyright Elsevier. LaTeX Project Public License (LPPL). Fetched from CTAN.

  cas-sc.cls, cas-dc.cls, cas-common.sty, cas-model2-names.bst
      Copyright Elsevier. LPPL. Fetched from CTAN (els-cas-templates).

  lipics-v2021.cls, oasics-v2021.cls
      Copyright Schloss Dagstuhl. LPPL. Fetched from
      https://github.com/dagstuhl-publishing/styles

  ceurart.cls
      Copyright Dmitry S. Kulyabov. LPPL. Fetched from
      https://github.com/yamadharma/ceurart

  acl.sty, acl_natbib.bst
      Association for Computational Linguistics. No licence is declared in
      the repository. Fetched from https://github.com/acl-org/acl-style-files

  cvpr.sty, ieeenat_fullname.bst
      IEEE/CVF CVPR. No licence is declared in the repository. Fetched from
      https://github.com/cvpr-org/author-kit

  tmlr.sty, tmlr.bst
      Transactions on Machine Learning Research. Apache License 2.0 (as
      declared by the repository). Fetched from
      https://github.com/JmlrOrg/tmlr-style-file

  mnras.cls, mnras.bst
      Copyright Royal Astronomical Society. LPPL. Fetched from CTAN.

  aastex701.cls, aasjournalv7.bst
      Copyright American Astronomical Society. LPPL. Fetched from CTAN.

  oup-authoring-template.cls, oup-plain.bst, oup-abbrvnat.bst
      Copyright Oxford University Press. LPPL. Fetched from CTAN.

  asmeconf.cls, asmeconf.bst, asmejour.cls, asmejour.bst
      Copyright John H. Lienhard V. MIT License. Fetched from CTAN.

  jacow.cls, quantumarticle.cls, quantum.bst, iacrj.cls
      Copyright their respective authors. LPPL. Fetched from CTAN.

  revtex4-2.cls, apa7.cls, achemso.cls, jmlr.cls, lni.cls, aastex63*.cls
      Detected and reported only; never downloaded or modified by this tool.

The test suite likewise fetches these files on demand into a gitignored
directory rather than vendoring them (see test/fixtures.js).

